						<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#F8F8F8" valign="top" height="40" class="windowbg2">Just a follow up,<br /><br />They did indeed contact me and seemed already quite upset.&nbsp; They said harsh language was used and they were offended.&nbsp; Well I did try to work it out and Vert and Hook offered to get them set up in a camp with Exp that they would stay well away from.&nbsp; He also offered rezzes which I tried to pass on, but they didn&#039;t want to hear anything about it.&nbsp; In fact probably the 3&#039;rd of 4&#039;th tell I got from them was that our guild sickens them.&nbsp; I apologized several time and even asked Vert and hook to work it out on their end as I was no where near there.&nbsp; They had already made up their mind and were just complaining to me.&nbsp; Not a whole lot to do at that point so as far as I was concerned the situation was over.<br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp;  I&#039;ve known Vertigion for almost as long as I can remember playing and Hookin has become a good friend as well.&nbsp; They do tend to be aggressive players but by no means have ever seen them intentionally harm or be rude to other players.<br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp;  I personally apologize again formally if you were &quot;Offended&quot; by anything they did or said but I do suggest next time you get in the zone you might want to check with the other folks there before you try to leap frog them, you may end up in a similar situation.&nbsp; Also next time you ask to talk to an officer, at least have the intention of trying to let them work it out.&nbsp; I get plenty of tells a night for things I&#039;m able to work out and fix.&nbsp; If you’re not going to give me that chance, you’re just wasting my time.<br /><br />&#039;T&#039;<br /></td>
